@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+# Cloudflare Agents runtime
+
+Static inspection covers only supported closed `Think` class shapes. It proves the direct `SupportAgent` instruction binding but not its spread runtime tool map, and proves `StepSupportAgent` without resolving the helper-built session instruction. `DelegatingSupportAgent` registers an ordinary function tool; its implementation reference to `StepSupportAgent` is not a handoff or routing target. `RuntimeInitializedAgent` is outside the selected closed class target and is not registered.
+
+For deployment, the Cloudflare configuration owner must export each registered class, maintain matching bindings and Durable Object migrations, supply required environment and model bindings, and verify the deployed Worker configuration. Static inspection does not perform or prove those deployment responsibilities.
